{"step_index":212,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-21T10:24:04Z","input_tokens":3080,"cache_read_tokens":129616,"output_tokens":80,"tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":"60","Path":"\"C:/Users/Kartik Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/README.md\"","StartLine":"1"}}]}
{"step_index":213,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-21T10:24:11Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-21T15:54:11+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-21T15:54:11+05:30\nShowing lines 1-60 of 243\n1: # 🌿 NexusMobility — Smart City Carpooling & Eco-Logistics Platform\n2: \n3: [![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-emerald.svg)](LICENSE)\n4: [![Standard: C++20](https://img.shields.io/badge/C%2B%2B-20%2F17-blue.svg)](https://isocpp.org/)\n5: [![UI: Modern Eco-Tech](https://img.shields.io/badge/UI-Eco--Tech%20Light-059669.svg)](#design-system--visual-aesthetic)\n6: [![Status: Production Ready](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Audited%20%26%20Hardened-green.svg)](#code-audit--stability-guarantees)\n7: \n8: **NexusMobility** is a modern, enterprise-ready smart urban transit and eco-carpooling platform engineered for smart city administrators, commuter networks, and fleet operators. It combines an ultra-clean, high-contrast eco-tech user interface with a robust, thread-safe C++ backend engine for real-time pathfinding, capacity scheduling, and carbon-reduction analytics.\n9: \n10: > [!NOTE]\n11: > **Zero CS / Academic Jargon Policy:** The entire user interface and documentation are framed strictly in terms of transit operations, passenger workflows, and sustainability metrics. Underlying computational techniques (Dijkstra shortest path, circular ring buffers, FIFO queues, LIFO rollback stacks) operate invisibly under the hood.\n12: \n13: ---\n14: \n15: ## 📑 Table of Contents\n16: - [🌟 Key Platform Capabilities](#-key-platform-capabilities)\n17: - [🎨 Design System & Visual Aesthetic](#-design-system--visual-aesthetic)\n18: - [🏛️ Tabbed Page Architecture](#️-tabbed-page-architecture)\n19: - [⚙️ Technical Architecture](#️-technical-architecture)\n20: - [🚀 Quick Start & Operation Guide](#-quick-start--operation-guide)\n21:   - [Option A: Standalone Front-End (Instant Run)](#option-a-standalone-front-end-instant-run)\n22:   - [Option B: Full-Stack with C++ REST API Server](#option-b-full-stack-with-c-rest-api-server)\n23: - [🔌 C++ REST API Reference](#-c-rest-api-reference)\n24: - [\n<truncated 302 bytes>\npolitan transit hubs and connecting corridors.\n33:    - Real-time route calculation with dynamic directional chevrons and animated electric transit vehicles driving along active transit paths.\n34:    - Mouse-driven 3D orbit and zoom controls with elevation stems and floor shadows.\n35: \n36: 2. **Dynamic Pooled Fare & CO₂ Offset Calculator**:\n37:    - Commuter density slider (1 to 4 passengers) showing real-time fare splitting and carbon reduction compared to single-occupancy vehicles.\n38: \n39: 3. **Live Commuter Dispatch Conveyor**:\n40:    - Smooth, priority-ordered passenger conveyor pipeline with real-time status tracking.\n41: \n42: 4. **Circular Priority Standby Lounge (5 Slots)**:\n43:    - Modulo-based fixed 5-slot standby lounge with visual circular ring layout, active pointer markers, and capacity overflow alerts.\n44: \n45: 5. **Driver Fleet Management & Interactive Vehicle Blueprint**:\n46:    - Top-down 4-seat vehicle blueprint with interactive seat toggling (Driver + 3 Passenger seats).\n47:    - Dynamic fleet partner capacity badges and fleet directory stream.\n48: \n49: 6. **Instant Identity Verification & Search**:\n50:    - Fast $O(1)$ search bar supporting Driver Partner IDs (e.g., `#101`) and Booking References (e.g., `NX-501`).\n51: \n52: 7. **Reversible Dispatch Audit Log (Rollback Stack)**:\n53:    - Enterprise-grade undo mechanism (`Revert Last Confirmation`) allowing dispatchers to instantly cancel erroneous confirmations, restore driver seats, and return passengers to the front of the queue without priority penalty.\n54: \n55: 8. **Enterprise Journey Modals & Printable Eco-Receipts**:\n56:    - Modal confirmation dialogs with alignment percentages, ETA, fare split, and printable physical receipts with `@media print` stylesheets.\n57: \n58: 9. **EcoSprout Mascot & Ambient Visuals**:\n59:    - Friendly vector eco-mascot (**EcoSprout**) with aviator goggles providing context-aware guidance during empty states.\n60:    - Ambient background canvas rendering gentle floating leaves and subtle electric energy nodes.","truncated_fields":["content"]}
{"step_index":214,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-21T10:24:11Z","input_tokens":3435,"cache_read_tokens":130642,"output_tokens":7825,"tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Updated index.html to fix congested layout: streamlined tab nav to flex-row wrap with badges, split Tab 1 into a spacious side-by-side workspace (controls panel on left, 3D spatial map canvas & metrics on right), and structured form groups cleanly with proper spacing.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","Content":"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\">\\n  <title>NexusMobility — Smart City Eco-Logistics & Carpooling Platform</title>\\n  <link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\\\">\\n  <link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\\\" crossorigin>\\n  <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\">\\n  <link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"styles.css\\\">\\n  <script src=\\\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/js/all.min.js\\\"></script>\\n</head>\\n<body class=\\\"bg-eco-light text-slate-800\\\">\\n  <!-- Ambient Eco Particle Canvas Layer (Leaves & Energy Nodes) -->\\n  <canvas id=\\\"ambient-canvas\\\" class=\\\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0\\\"></canvas>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"app-layout relative z-10\\\">\\n    <!-- Top Header Navigation -->\\n    <header class=\\\"app-header white-card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"brand-section\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"brand-icon\\\">\\n          <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-leaf text-emerald\\\"></i>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"brand-title-wrap\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"brand-title\\\">\\n            <span>Nexus<span class=\\\"text-emerald\\\">Mobility</span></span>\\n            <span class=\\\"brand-badge\\\">Enterprise Eco-Tech</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"brand-tagline\\\">SMART TRANSIT & URBAN ECO-LOGISTICS SUITE</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Essential Primary Action Controls -->\\n      <div class=\\\"nav-actions\\\">\\n        <button id=\\\"btn-demo-rushhour\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-emerald-outline\\\" title=\\\"Simulate realistic metropolitan rush hour traffic\\\">\\n          <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-bolt-lightning text-emerald\\\"></i> Rush-Hour Simulation\\n        </button>\\n        <button id=\\\"btn-quick-book\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">\\n          <i class=\\\"fa-solid fa-calendar-check\\\"></i> Book Eco-Ride\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\\n<truncated 29488 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:/Users/Kartik Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
